msgid ""
"The sequence is ``a a b a c a a``: five turns for ``a``, one each for "
"``b`` and ``c``, and the light servers are spread between the heavy "
"server's turns instead of bunched at the end. The credits after step 7 "
"are those of the start, so the pattern repeats."
msgstr ""
"选择序列是 ``a a b a c a a``：``a`` 轮到五次，``b`` 和 ``c`` "
"各一次，轻量服务器分散在重量服务器的轮次之间，而不是挤在末尾。第 7 步之后的积分与开始时相同，因此这一模式会重复。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:146
msgid "Least Connections and Two Choices"
msgstr "最少连接与二选一"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:149
msgid ""
"Weighted least connections, the default of a standalone pool, chooses the "
"server with the fewest active flows per unit of weight. The comparison "
"avoids division: server :math:`i` is preferred to server :math:`j` when "
":math:`a_i w_j < a_j w_i`, where :math:`a` counts active flows. Ties are "
"broken by the requests admitted since the pool was loaded, again per unit "
"of weight, and a backup always ranks after a primary."
msgstr ""
"加权最少连接是独立服务器池的默认调度器，它选择每单位权重活动流最少的服务器。比较时避免除法：当 :math:`a_i w_j < a_j w_i` "
"时，服务器 :math:`i` 优先于服务器 :math:`j`，其中 :math:`a` "
"是活动流数。平局时按服务器池加载以来已准入的请求数（同样按每单位权重）决定，备用服务器总是排在主服务器之后。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:151
msgid ""
"The power of two choices with a peak-weighted moving latency "
"(``p2c_pewma``) hashes the flow to two distinct eligible servers and "
"takes the cheaper one, where the cost of server :math:`i` is :math:`(a_i "
"+ 1)\\,\\ell_i / w_i`. The latency estimate :math:`\\ell_i` reacts to a "
"slow sample at once and forgets it slowly: a new sample :math:`s` sets "
":math:`\\ell \\leftarrow \\max(s, (7\\ell + s)/8)`, and an idle server's "
"estimate moves halfway back to its resting value of 1 ms for each second "
"without a sample."
msgstr ""
"带峰值加权移动延迟的二选一（``p2c_pewma``）把流哈希到两台不同的合格服务器上，并选择成本较低的一台，其中服务器 :math:`i` "
"的成本为 :math:`(a_i + 1)\\,\\ell_i / w_i`。延迟估计 :math:`\\ell_i` "
"对慢样本立即作出反应，并缓慢地忘记它：新样本 :math:`s` 令 :math:`\\ell \\leftarrow \\max(s, "
"(7\\ell + s)/8)`，而空闲服务器的估计值每过一秒没有样本，就向其静息值 1 ms 回退一半。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:153
msgid "Consistent Hashing: the Problem"
msgstr "一致性哈希：问题"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:156
msgid ""
"Several nodes of a cluster should send the same flow to the same server "
"without talking to each other, and a change of the server set should move "
"as few flows as possible. The obvious method, server :math:`h \\bmod N` "
"for a flow hash :math:`h`, fails the second requirement badly."
msgstr ""
"集群中的多个节点应当在互不通信的情况下把同一个流发往同一台服务器，并且服务器集合发生变化时，应当迁移尽可能少的流。显而易见的方法是对流哈希 "
":math:`h` 选择服务器 :math:`h \\bmod N`，它严重违背了第二个要求。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:158
msgid "Worked example: one of five servers leaves"
msgstr "实例分析：五台服务器中的一台离开"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:160
msgid ""
"Under modulo hashing, a flow with hash :math:`h` goes to position "
":math:`h \\bmod 5`, and after the departure to position :math:`h \\bmod "
"4` of the list of the four survivors. By the Chinese remainder theorem "
"the pair :math:`(h \\bmod 5, h \\bmod 4)` takes each of the :math:`5 "
"\\times 4 = 20` values with probability :math:`1/20` for a uniform hash. "
"A flow stays on its server only when both positions name the same "
"survivor, and each of the 4 survivors is named by exactly one such pair. "
"So :math:`4/20 = 20\\%` of the flows stay and **80% move**, although only "
"the 20% that the departed server held had to. In general a step from "
":math:`N` to :math:`N - 1` servers keeps :math:`(N-1)/(N(N-1)) = 1/N` of "
"the flows."
msgstr ""
"在取模哈希下，哈希为 :math:`h` 的流去往位置 :math:`h \\bmod 5`，离开之后去往四台幸存服务器列表中的位置 "
":math:`h \\bmod 4`。由中国剩余定理，对于均匀哈希，数对 :math:`(h \\bmod 5, h \\bmod 4)` 以概率 "
":math:`1/20` 取 :math:`5 \\times 4 = 20` "
"个值中的每一个。只有当两个位置指向同一台幸存服务器时，流才留在原服务器上，而 4 台幸存服务器中的每一台恰好被一个这样的数对指向。因此 "
":math:`4/20 = 20\\%` 的流留下，而 **80% 会迁移**，尽管只有离开的服务器所持有的 20% 才必须迁移。一般地，从 "
":math:`N` 台服务器变为 :math:`N - 1` 台时，保留 :math:`(N-1)/(N(N-1)) = 1/N` 的流。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:162
msgid ""
"A consistent method moves only the departed server's flows: :math:`1/5 = "
"20\\%`. Rendezvous hashing, below, achieves exactly that. Sibuna's Maglev "
"table achieves it up to a small excess. We rebuilt the table for five "
"servers named ``s1`` to ``s5`` of equal weight, with a copy of the build "
"loop of ``maglev.rs`` and the same hash, and removed each server in turn "
"(our own run, not a benchmark). The departed server held 19.999% to "
"20.001% of the 65,537 slots, and between 51 and 121 other slots, 0.08% to "
"0.19% of the table, changed owner as well. Adding a sixth server gave it "
"16.665% of the slots and moved 64 slots, 0.10%, between the old servers. "
"With ten servers the departed one held 9.999% to 10.000% of the slots, "
"and 120 to 181 other slots, 0.18% to 0.28%, changed owner."
msgstr ""
"一致性的方法只迁移离开的服务器的流：:math:`1/5 = 20\\%`。下面介绍的 rendezvous 哈希恰好做到了这一点。Sibuna "
"的 Maglev 表在一个很小的超额范围内做到了这一点。我们用 ``maglev.rs`` 构建循环的副本和相同的哈希，为名为 ``s1`` 到 "
"``s5`` 的五台等权重服务器重建了这张表，并依次删除每台服务器（这是我们自己的运行，不是基准测试）。离开的服务器持有 65,537 个槽中的 "
"19.999% 到 20.001%，另外还有 51 到 121 个槽（占表的 0.08% 到 "
"0.19%）也更换了所有者。加入第六台服务器时，它得到 16.665% 的槽，并有 64 "
"个槽（0.10%）在原有服务器之间迁移。有十台服务器时，离开的那台持有 9.999% 到 10.000% 的槽，另有 120 到 181 "
"个槽（0.18% 到 0.28%）更换了所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:164
msgid "Maglev as Sibuna Builds It"
msgstr "Sibuna 构建的 Maglev"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:167
msgid ""
"Maglev (Eisenbud et al., 2016) fills a lookup table of :math:`M` slots. "
"Each server derives two numbers from its name, an offset and a stride, "
"which define its preference order :math:`p_k = (\\mathrm{offset} + k "
"\\cdot \\mathrm{stride}) \\bmod M`. The servers then take turns, and in "
"its turn a server claims the first slot of its order that is still empty. "
"Sibuna takes :math:`M = 65537`, a prime, so every stride from 1 to "
":math:`M - 1` visits every slot. It weights the turns with the same "
"smooth round robin as above, so a server of weight :math:`w_i` claims "
":math:`w_i/W` of the slots, within one slot. A flow is looked up by "
"hashing the frontend address and the client address with its port: one "
"hash and one load."
msgstr ""
"Maglev（Eisenbud 等，2016）填充一张有 :math:`M` "
"个槽的查找表。每台服务器从其名称导出两个数，即偏移量和步长，它们定义了该服务器的偏好顺序 :math:`p_k = "
"(\\mathrm{offset} + k \\cdot \\mathrm{stride}) \\bmod "
"M`。然后服务器轮流行动，每台服务器在自己的轮次中占据其顺序中第一个仍为空的槽。Sibuna 取 :math:`M = "
"65537`，这是一个素数，因此从 1 到 :math:`M - 1` 的每个步长都会访问每个槽。它用上面同样的平滑轮询为轮次加权，因此权重为 "
":math:`w_i` 的服务器占据 :math:`w_i/W` "
"的槽，误差在一个槽以内。查找一个流时，对前端地址以及客户端地址和端口进行哈希：一次哈希和一次读取。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:169
msgid "Implementation: ``Table::build`` and ``Table::primary``"
msgstr "实现：``Table::build`` 和 ``Table::primary``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:171
msgid ""
"``build`` fills the 65,537 slots from servers in stable name order, "
"skipping backups, with smooth weighted turns. ``primary`` hashes the "
"frontend and the client endpoint, IPv4 mapped into IPv6, to a slot. In "
"``crates/lb/src/maglev.rs``."
msgstr ""
"``build`` 按稳定的名称顺序，跳过备用服务器，以平滑加权轮次从服务器填充 65,537 个槽。``primary`` "
"把前端和客户端端点（IPv4 映射到 IPv6）哈希到一个槽。位于 ``crates/lb/src/maglev.rs``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:173
msgid ""
"for _ in 0..SIZE {\n"
"    let mut best = 0;\n"
"    for i in 0..permutations.len() {\n"
"        permutations[i].4 += i64::from(permutations[i].3);\n"
"        if permutations[i].4 > permutations[best].4 {\n"
"            best = i;\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    let (index, next, stride, _, credit) = &mut permutations[best];\n"
"    *credit -= i64::from(weight);\n"
"    while slots[*next] != EMPTY {\n"
"        *next = (*next + *stride) % SIZE;\n"
"    }\n"
"    slots[*next] = *index;\n"
"    *next = (*next + *stride) % SIZE;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:192
msgid ""
"Every node builds the same table from the same file, so every node sends "
"a flow with the same addresses to the same server. This is why the "
"membership and the weights of a Maglev pool change only by reload. An "
"admin command that changed the weight on one node would make that node "
"disagree with its peers, and the admin socket refuses it (SID 0018). A "
"drain is allowed, because each node already excludes servers by its own "
"health checks."
msgstr ""
"每个节点都从同一个文件构建同一张表，因此每个节点都把地址相同的流发往同一台服务器。这就是为什么 Maglev "
"服务器池的成员和权重只能通过重新加载来改变。在一个节点上修改权重的管理命令会使该节点与其对等节点不一致，因此管理套接字拒绝这种命令（SID "
"0018）。排空是允许的，因为每个节点本来就会根据自己的健康检查排除服务器。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:194
msgid "Bounded Loads"
msgstr "有界负载"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:197
msgid ""
"A hash spreads flows evenly only on average. A popular client range can "
"still crowd one server. Consistent hashing with bounded loads (Mirrokni, "
"Thorup and Zadimoghaddam, 2018) caps each server at a constant factor "
":math:`c \\ge 1` times its fair share. Sibuna applies the cap to the "
"Maglev primary. Let :math:`L` be the active flows of the pool and "
":math:`a_p` those of the primary :math:`p`. The new flow goes to the "
"primary when it is eligible and"
msgstr ""
"哈希只在平均意义上把流均匀分散。一个热门的客户端地址段仍可能挤满一台服务器。带有界负载的一致性哈希（Mirrokni、Thorup 和 "
"Zadimoghaddam，2018）把每台服务器的负载限制在其公平份额的常数倍 :math:`c \\ge 1` 以内。Sibuna "
"把这一上限应用于 Maglev 首选服务器。令 :math:`L` 为服务器池的活动流数，:math:`a_p` 为首选服务器 :math:`p` "
"的活动流数。当首选服务器合格并且"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:199
msgid "a_p < \\left\\lceil \\frac{c\\,(L + 1)\\, w_p}{W} \\right\\rceil,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:203
msgid ""
"with :math:`c` given in percent as ``load_factor_pct`` (125 by default, "
"at least 100). Otherwise the flow goes to the pool's fallback: weighted "
"least connections, or the power of two choices when ``fallback`` is "
"``pewma``."
msgstr ""
"时，新流去往首选服务器，其中 :math:`c` 以百分比形式由 ``load_factor_pct`` 给出（默认 125，至少 "
"100）。否则流去往服务器池的后备调度器：加权最少连接，或者当 ``fallback`` 为 ``pewma`` 时使用二选一。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:205
msgid "Worked example: the bound with c = 1.25"
msgstr "实例分析：c = 1.25 时的上界"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:207
msgid ""
"Four servers of equal weight hold :math:`L = 99` flows, and a hundredth "
"arrives. The bound is :math:`\\lceil 1.25 \\times 100 / 4 \\rceil = "
"\\lceil 31.25 \\rceil = 32`. A primary with 31 flows takes the new one "
"and reaches 32. A primary with 32 flows refuses it, and least connections "
"places it on a server with the fewest flows, at most :math:`\\lfloor 99/4 "
"\\rfloor = 24`. With weights 3 and 1 and :math:`L + 1 = 40`, the bounds "
"are :math:`\\lceil 1.25 \\times 40 \\times 3/4 \\rceil = \\lceil 37.5 "
"\\rceil = 38` and :math:`\\lceil 1.25 \\times 40 / 4 \\rceil = \\lceil "
"12.5 \\rceil = 13`."
msgstr ""
"四台等权重服务器持有 :math:`L = 99` 个流，第一百个流到达。上界为 :math:`\\lceil 1.25 \\times 100 "
"/ 4 \\rceil = \\lceil 31.25 \\rceil = 32`。持有 31 个流的首选服务器接受新流，达到 32。持有 32 "
"个流的首选服务器拒绝它，最少连接把它放到流最少的服务器上，该服务器至多有 :math:`\\lfloor 99/4 \\rfloor = 24` "
"个流。权重为 3 和 1 且 :math:`L + 1 = 40` 时，上界分别为 :math:`\\lceil 1.25 \\times 40 "
"\\times 3/4 \\rceil = \\lceil 37.5 \\rceil = 38` 和 :math:`\\lceil 1.25 "
"\\times 40 / 4 \\rceil = \\lceil 12.5 \\rceil = 13`。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:209
msgid ""
"The overflow always finds a server below its bound. Suppose every server "
":math:`i` held at least :math:`c(L+1)w_i/W` flows. Summing over the "
"servers gives :math:`L \\ge c(L+1) > L`, a contradiction. With :math:`c = "
"1.25` and four equal servers, at most three can sit at the bound at once."
msgstr ""
"溢出的流总能找到一台低于上界的服务器。假设每台服务器 :math:`i` 都至少持有 :math:`c(L+1)w_i/W` "
"个流。对所有服务器求和得到 :math:`L \\ge c(L+1) > L`，矛盾。当 :math:`c = 1.25` "
"且有四台等权重服务器时，至多三台可以同时处于上界。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:211
msgid ""
"With the least-connections fallback, and all servers eligible, one "
"admission keeps every server within its cap: the hash path admits only "
"below the bound, and the fallback chooses a server whose flows per unit "
"of weight are at most the average :math:`L/W`, so that one more flow "
"still fits under :math:`\\lceil c(L+1)w_i/W \\rceil`. This is "
"``admitBounded_respects_cap`` of the Lean model of SID 0015, for one "
"sequential admission. Two threads that admit at the same moment may both "
"read the old counts. With the ``pewma`` fallback the hash path still "
"respects the bound, but the fallback chooses by latency, and the cap is "
"then not a guarantee. The overflow also departs from the paper in one "
"respect: it does not walk to the next server of a consistent order, so "
"two nodes may place an overflowing flow on different servers."
msgstr ""
"使用最少连接后备调度器且所有服务器都合格时，一次准入使每台服务器都保持在其上限之内：哈希路径只在低于上界时准入，而后备调度器选择每单位权重流数至多为平均值 "
":math:`L/W` 的服务器，因此再多一个流仍然不超过 :math:`\\lceil c(L+1)w_i/W \\rceil`。这就是 SID "
"0015 的 Lean 模型中针对一次顺序准入的 "
"``admitBounded_respects_cap``。同时准入的两个线程可能都读到旧的计数。使用 ``pewma`` "
"后备调度器时，哈希路径仍然遵守上界，但后备调度器按延迟选择，此时上限就不再是保证。溢出处理还在一个方面偏离了论文：它不会沿着一致的顺序走到下一台服务器，因此两个节点可能把一个溢出的流放到不同的服务器上。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:213
msgid "Rendezvous Hashing for Source Stickiness"
msgstr "用于源地址粘性的 rendezvous 哈希"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:216
msgid ""
"A pool with ``sticky: \"source\"`` sends each client address to the same "
"server. It uses weighted rendezvous hashing (SID 0019). For client "
":math:`x` and server :math:`i` the hash gives a number :math:`u_i \\in "
"(0, 1]`, and the *distance* is"
msgstr ""
"带 ``sticky: \"source\"`` 的服务器池把每个客户端地址发往同一台服务器。它使用加权 rendezvous 哈希（SID "
"0019）。对于客户端 :math:`x` 和服务器 :math:`i`，哈希给出一个数 :math:`u_i \\in (0, 1]`，而\\ "
"*距离*\\ 为"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:218
msgid "d_i = \\frac{-\\log_2 u_i}{w_i}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:222
msgid ""
"The client goes to the nearest eligible server. The choice follows the "
"weights exactly. Since :math:`-\\ln u_i` is exponentially distributed "
"with mean 1 for uniform :math:`u_i`, :math:`d_i` is exponential with rate "
"proportional to :math:`w_i`. The minimum of independent exponentials with "
"rates :math:`w_i` is attained at server :math:`i` with probability "
":math:`w_i / \\sum_j w_j`. The base of the logarithm changes all "
"distances by one factor and no ranking."
msgstr ""
"客户端去往最近的合格服务器。这一选择精确地遵循权重。由于对均匀的 :math:`u_i`，:math:`-\\ln u_i` 服从均值为 1 "
"的指数分布，:math:`d_i` 服从速率与 :math:`w_i` 成正比的指数分布。速率为 :math:`w_i` "
"的独立指数随机变量的最小值以概率 :math:`w_i / \\sum_j w_j` 在服务器 :math:`i` "
"处取得。对数的底只会让所有距离乘上同一个因子，不改变排序。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:224
msgid ""
"The disruption is exactly the minimum. When server :math:`k` leaves, a "
"client whose nearest server was not :math:`k` keeps it, because removing "
"one candidate cannot change the minimum of the others. Only the clients "
"of :math:`k` move, each to its own second choice, and they return when "
":math:`k` returns. Sibuna computes the logarithm in fixed point with 16 "
"fractional bits and compares :math:`d_i < d_j` as :math:`c_i w_j < c_j "
"w_i` without division."
msgstr ""
"扰动恰好是最小的。服务器 :math:`k` 离开时，最近服务器不是 :math:`k` "
"的客户端保持原来的服务器，因为去掉一个候选者不会改变其余候选者的最小值。只有 :math:`k` 的客户端会迁移，各自去往自己的第二选择，并在 "
":math:`k` 回来时返回。Sibuna 用带 16 位小数的定点数计算对数，并把 :math:`d_i < d_j` 作为 "
":math:`c_i w_j < c_j w_i` 比较，不做除法。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:226
msgid ""
"Ranking every server for every request costs one hash and one logarithm "
"per server. So the pool precomputes a table of 1,021 slots. A client "
"address is hashed to a slot, and the slot stores its four nearest "
"servers. The first eligible one serves; when none of the four is "
"eligible, the whole pool is ranked for that slot. The measured choice no "
"longer grows with the pool: 148 to 188 ns at 128 servers, against 3,443 "
"ns before the table and the lock-free snapshot (SID 0019). The price is "
"granularity: two addresses in one slot share their server, and a server "
"of weight 1 in a pool of weight 1,000 serves one slot, not a thousandth "
"of the clients."
msgstr ""
"为每个请求对每台服务器排序，每台服务器要花费一次哈希和一次对数运算。因此服务器池预先计算一张 1,021 "
"个槽的表。客户端地址被哈希到一个槽，槽中保存离它最近的四台服务器。第一台合格的服务器提供服务；四台都不合格时，为该槽对整个服务器池排序。测得的选择耗时不再随服务器池增长：128 "
"台服务器时为 148 到 188 ns，而在引入这张表和无锁快照之前为 3,443 ns（SID "
"0019）。代价是粒度：同一个槽中的两个地址共用一台服务器，在总权重为 1,000 的服务器池中，权重为 1 "
"的服务器服务的是一个槽，而不是千分之一的客户端。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:228
msgid "Implementation: ``Pool::home`` and ``sticky::distance``"
msgstr "实现：``Pool::home`` 和 ``sticky::distance``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:230
msgid ""
"``home`` hashes the client to a slot and returns the first eligible "
"server of the slot's four, falling back to ranking the pool. ``distance`` "
"computes the fixed-point cost :math:`64 - \\log_2(\\mathrm{draw})` with "
"its weight. In ``crates/lb/src/pool/extra.rs`` and "
"``crates/lb/src/sticky.rs``."
msgstr ""
"``home`` 把客户端哈希到一个槽，返回该槽四台服务器中第一台合格的服务器，否则退回到对服务器池排序。``distance`` "
"计算带权重的定点成本 :math:`64 - \\log_2(\\mathrm{draw})`。位于 "
"``crates/lb/src/pool/extra.rs`` 和 ``crates/lb/src/sticky.rs``。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:234
msgid ""
"Rendezvous hashing moves exactly the departed server's clients; the "
"Maglev table moves them and about 0.1% more. Explain where the excess "
"comes from in the fill loop above, and why Sibuna accepts it for flows "
"hashed by address and port but uses rendezvous hashing for clients that "
"must find the same server tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"rendezvous 哈希恰好只迁移离开的服务器的客户端；Maglev 表迁移这些客户端以及大约 0.1% "
"的额外部分。解释上面的填充循环中这部分超额从何而来，以及为什么 Sibuna "
"对按地址和端口哈希的流接受这一超额，却对明天还必须找到同一台服务器的客户端使用 rendezvous 哈希。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:236
msgid "Health, Slow Start, Draining and Failover"
msgstr "健康、慢启动、排空与故障转移"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:239
msgid ""
"A server can be out of rotation for five reasons, and each has its own "
"way back. Active probes and passive health judge the server; a failed "
"connect judges one attempt; a drain is the operator's word; slow start "
"governs the return."
msgstr ""
"一台服务器可能因五种原因退出轮换，每种原因都有自己的返回方式。主动探测和被动健康检查评判服务器；连接失败评判的是一次尝试；排空是运维人员的决定；慢启动管理返回过程。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/edge.rst:242
msgid ""
"In service leads to Down after fall failed probes, to Ejected after "
"consecutive request failures, to Marked after a failed connect, and to "
"Drained by an operator. Down returns after rise passed probes, Ejected "
"after the ejection time, Marked after two seconds, Drained when "
"readmitted. Each return leads to Ramping, which leads to In service after "
"the ramp."
msgstr ""
"“服务中”在 fall "
"次探测失败后变为“宕机”，在连续请求失败后变为“已剔除”，在连接失败后变为“已标记”，由运维人员操作变为“已排空”。“宕机”在 rise "
"次探测通过后返回，“已剔除”在剔除时间之后返回，“已标记”在两秒后返回，“已排空”在重新准入时返回。每次返回都进入“爬升中”，爬升结束后进入“服务中”。"

